      "n": "WrongAnswerAudio1"
    },
    {
      "s": "",
      "t": "A",
      "n": "Intro2Audio"
    },
    {
      "s": "D'Artagnan est à peu près la star des Trois Mousquetaires mais il passe tout le livre dans le rôle du Mousquetaire n°4. ",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "749340_2",
      "n": "ExplanationAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "Les « Trois Mousquetaires » dans le titre représentent... Porthos... euh, Huey... et... Martin Short. ",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "749341_1",
      "n": "JokeAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "If the musketeer left out of the umbrella term “Three Musketeers” angrily trademarked their own candy bar, what could they call it?",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "749337_1",
      "n": "QuestionAudio"
    }
  ]
